---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Process & Methodology"
  description="How Algoryxz delivers agency-grade digital experiences in days with clear boundaries, fixed scopes, and zero hostage assets."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="page-header">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Methodology & Rigor</span>
        <h1 class="page-title">How We Work</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">
          We combine internal AI agent acceleration with strict human founder gates. Transparent stages, fixed scope, and zero ambiguity.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="process-steps-vertical">
        <!-- STAGE 1 -->
        <div class="stage-item">
          <div class="stage-marker">01</div>
          <div class="stage-content">
            <span class="stage-owner">Akriti & Client Owner</span>
            <h2 class="stage-title">Qualification, Discovery & SOW</h2>
            <p class="stage-desc">
              We define the exact business problem, score the project complexity, and deliver a fixed-scope Statement of Work (SOW). No hidden fees, no open-ended billing.
            </p>
            <div class="stage-rules">
              <span class="rule-tag">Exit Condition: Deposit cleared in studio account</span>
              <span class="rule-tag">Scope locked to 2 revision rounds</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STAGE 2 -->
        <div class="stage-item">
          <div class="stage-marker">02</div>
          <div class="stage-content">
            <span class="stage-owner">Deeptiman (Design Sign-off Gate)</span>
            <h2 class="stage-title">Art Direction & Design Gate</h2>
            <p class="stage-desc">
              Deeptiman shapes the visual identity, typography system, component states, and motion choreography. We present an interactive layout preview for your approval.
            </p>
            <div class="stage-rules">
              <span class="rule-tag">Exit Condition: Deeptiman sign-off + Client milestone approval</span>
              <span class="rule-tag">Zero code starts until design is locked</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STAGE 3 -->
        <div class="stage-item">
          <div class="stage-marker">03</div>
          <div class="stage-content">
            <span class="stage-owner">Smarak (Engineering Architecture)</span>
            <h2 class="stage-title">Edge Build & 2-Revision Standard</h2>
            <p class="stage-desc">
              We construct the application using static-first architecture on Cloudflare Pages. Interactive preview URLs let you inspect live builds on real staging URLs.
            </p>
            <div class="stage-rules">
              <span class="rule-tag">The 2-Revision Standard: Batched feedback only</span>
              <span class="rule-tag">Free 30-day bug fix guarantee</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STAGE 4 -->
        <div class="stage-item">
          <div class="stage-marker">04</div>
          <div class="stage-content">
            <span class="stage-owner">Akriti (Physical Device QA Gate)</span>
            <h2 class="stage-title">Real-Device Mobile QA</h2>
            <p class="stage-desc">
              Synthetic desktop browser resize is not enough. Akriti runs our comprehensive QA checklist on physical Android and iOS devices, testing touch targets, keyboard insets, and slow 4G network performance.
            </p>
            <div class="stage-rules">
              <span class="rule-tag">Exit Condition: Physical device sign-off</span>
              <span class="rule-tag">Zero critical bugs or layout breaks</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STAGE 5 -->
        <div class="stage-item">
          <div class="stage-marker">05</div>
          <div class="stage-content">
            <span class="stage-owner">Smarak & Client Owner</span>
            <h2 class="stage-title">Final Balance, DNS Cutover & Handover</h2>
            <p class="stage-desc">
              Once staging is approved and final balance clears, we cut over DNS to your custom domain with automated SSL. We deliver an encrypted handover packet via Bitwarden Send.
            </p>
            <div class="stage-rules">
              <span class="rule-tag">Client is always the 100% legal domain registrant</span>
              <span class="rule-tag">Zero assets held hostage</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="guarantees-grid">
        <div class="guarantee-box">
          <h3>The 2-Revision Rule</h3>
          <p>
            Every fixed-price project includes two consolidated revision rounds submitted in batched lists. This keeps velocity high and eliminates endless micro-tweaks.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="guarantee-box">
          <h3>Asset Independence</h3>
          <p>
            You own your code, your domain, and your media. If you ever leave our Care plan, we hand over all source code and DNS records unconditionally within 5 business days.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .section-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .page-title {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .process-steps-vertical {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-20);
  }

  .stage-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-12);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
  }

  .stage-marker {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .stage-owner {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .stage-title {
    font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .stage-desc {
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .stage-rules {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .rule-tag {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
  }

  .guarantees-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    padding-top: var(--space-12);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
  }

  .guarantee-box {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .guarantee-box h3 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .guarantee-box p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .stage-item {
      grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-8);
    }

    .guarantees-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
